@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch15ch16-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch15ch16-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 15 and 16"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.3.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch15ch16-lineage/1.3.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch15ch16_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.3.0 (2026-11-11): Backlog stage - real state-check for chapters 15-16. No legacy YA-suffixed duplicate decks were found for either chapter (unlike chapters 11-14), so unlike Lineage5's backlog there is no retirement story here."@en .

## --- Backlog ---

ex:Backlog6 a backlog:Backlog ;
    rdfs:label "Chapters 15-16 backlog"@en ;
    backlog:backlogForMission ex:Mission6 ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage6 ;
    backlog:hasBacklogMember ex:ST6_StateCheck, ex:ST6_DraftCh15, ex:ST6_DraftCh16, ex:ST6_ApprovalGate, ex:ST6_RenderCh15, ex:ST6_RenderCh16 .

ex:ST6_StateCheck a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Real state-check of chapters 15-16 materials"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage6 ;
    backlog:decomposesInto ex:TK6_StateCheck_Ch15, ex:TK6_StateCheck_Ch16 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Done .

ex:TK6_StateCheck_Ch15 a backlog:Task ; rdfs:label "State-check chapter 15 materials"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage6 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Checked from live files, not memory. Deck: SEN0414_Ch15_GoogleSheets_3e_v2_0_0.pptx, the only deck version, is the deck the register's own control-verdict comments confirm Done for TK_Ret_Ch15_Deck_Build, no NOT MET outstanding. Page: sen0414_ch15_page_v9_96_1.html is the latest and delivered version; v9_96_0 failed its leak probe on all five seeds (control-iter20-logs/leak_ch15_v9_96_0_template_9_52_4_FAIL_controller_run.log) and was repaired; v9_96_1's own leak-probe re-run (control-iter20-logs/leak_ch15_v9_96_1_template_9_52_4_controller_run.log) and page checks (control-iter20-logs/pagechk_Page_Ch15_v9_96_1_run1-3.log, RESULT Page/Ch15: PASS) are clean. Stories: sen0414_ch15_stories_v1_0_1.py defines 5 stories, self-check 0 failures. Code: chapter_code_ch15_v1_0_0.json manifest lists 25 examples, matching the deck. Resources slide not yet individually re-verified link-by-link in this pass (will be checked again when the chapter-15 draft is written, same as every earlier chapter). New item found, out of scope per Excl6_Rdodi: 03-materials/ch15/rdodi/ holds a separate, versioned (v1.0.0-v1.0.4) research/domain-ontology artifact set (document .docx/.ttl, domain ABox/TBox/SHACL, research .ttl) from the earlier iteration-20 process; left untouched. No legacy YA-suffixed duplicate deck exists for chapter 15; nothing to retire." .

ex:TK6_StateCheck_Ch16 a backlog:Task ; rdfs:label "State-check chapter 16 materials"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage6 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Checked from live files, not memory. Deck: two versions exist, SEN0414_Ch16_SQLiteDatabases_3e_v2_0_0.pptx and _v2_0_1.pptx; the register's own audit note for TK_Ret_Ch16_Deck_Build states v2_0_0 was committed, then re-built and re-committed inside the same task as v2_0_1 (an intra-task modification visible only via git log --name-status, not the planning commit), and that v2_0_1 (54 slides, 25 examples, 6 stories) is the controlled, delivered file; v2_0_0 is NOT delivered. The chapter-code manifest naming the deck is chapter_code_ch16_v1_0_1.json (25 examples), not the older chapter_code_ch16_v1_0_0.json. Page: sen0414_ch16_page_v9_97_0.html is the latest and delivered version; v9_96_0 passed its leak probe but failed page test 9.37.0 at 1366px (control-iter20-logs/p37_ch16_v9_96_0_t37_FAIL_controller_run.log, P1/P9 overflow) and was repaired with a narrower Playground starter file; v9_97_0's own leak-probe re-run, width check at 1366/1400/390px, and page checks are all clean (control-iter20-logs/leak_ch16_v9_97_0_template_9_52_4_controller_run.log, width_ch16_v9_97_0_controller_run.log, pagechk_Page_Ch16_v9_97_0_run1-3.log, RESULT Page/Ch16: PASS). Stories: sen0414_ch16_stories_v1_0_0.py defines 6 stories. Code: 25 examples per the v1_0_1 manifest, matching the delivered deck. Resources slide not yet individually re-verified link-by-link in this pass (will be checked when the chapter-16 draft is written). New item found, out of scope per Excl6_Rdodi: 03-materials/ch16/rdodi/ holds the same kind of separate research/domain-ontology artifact set as chapter 15; left untouched. No legacy YA-suffixed duplicate deck exists for chapter 16; nothing to retire. Note for context, not action: regression-check logs exist (regr_Research_Ch01_after_ch16.log through regr_Research_Ch09_after_ch16.log) showing chapter 16's own build triggered cross-chapter regression re-checks on chapters 1-9 under the old process; those are historical and outside this lineage's scope." .

ex:ST6_DraftCh15 a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Write chapter 15 draft for owner approval"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage6 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:ST6_DraftCh16 a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Write chapter 16 draft for owner approval"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage6 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:ST6_ApprovalGate a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Owner reads and approves both drafts"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage6 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    rdfs:comment "Blocked on ST6_DraftCh15 and ST6_DraftCh16."@en .
ex:ST6_RenderCh15 a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Render/confirm chapter 15 deck+page from the approved draft"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage6 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    rdfs:comment "Blocked on ST6_ApprovalGate, per Excl6_RenderBeforeApproval."@en .
ex:ST6_RenderCh16 a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Render/confirm chapter 16 deck+page from the approved draft"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage6 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    rdfs:comment "Blocked on ST6_ApprovalGate, per Excl6_RenderBeforeApproval."@en .

## --- Objective status correction (append-only; Obs1 now that the real tasks exist) ---

ex:Lineage6 backlog:hasLineageStatus backlog:LS_InProgress .

ex:Obs1_Obj6_StateChecksRecorded a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj6_StateChecksRecorded ;
    backlog:observedValue 2 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-11T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Measured: TK6_StateCheck_Ch15 and TK6_StateCheck_Ch16 both Done with real, file-verified audit notes. Target 2 reached."@en .
